<title>INDIA: Yield on Indian 91-day t-bill drops to 7.23 pct.</title>
<headline>Yield on Indian 91-day t-bill drops to 7.23 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Friday it set a cut-off of 98.23 rupees at its weekly auction of 91-day treasury bills, up from 98.05 at the last auction.</p>
<p>Dealers said the yield dropped to 7.23 percent from 7.98.</p>
